# set: bars=32 phase=10-hipervelocidad energy=9
# set-note: Last stretch of the peak: the wide screamer against the first riff, glitch drums with the turns, shard's last gesture.
# cue: 21 B1 held + K3 ↑ slowly · shard motor, RPM up
# cue: 24.75 let go of B1 (K3 to center)
